      "content": "hey so i have this massive headache right now. it hit me super fast like literally out of nowhere, it's like the worst one i've ever had. i mostly get migraines tho so i'm thinking it's just a really bad episode. i have my sumatriptan here, is it okay if i just take an extra dose of that or should i wait a bit? i'm feeling a little nauseous too.",
