    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'll hold off on the double dose then. i'll just take some ibuprofen like you said. i'm sure it's just one of those heavy stress days. i'm starting to feel a bit dizzy and the light is making it way worse, but i think once the ibuprofen kicks in i can just lie down in a dark room and sleep it off. i'll be fine by morning right?",
